Package: stratapermexact
Type: Package
Title: Bounded Exact Stratified Assignment Masses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Lofrano Tecnologia", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Martin", "Lofrano", role = "cre",
    email = "108959625+martinlofranodeoliveira@users.noreply.github.com"))
Description: Computes exact integer masses for uniformly weighted two-label
    assignments preserving supplied stratum selection counts. Original
    selected-count and score dynamic programming is followed by exact
    convolution. Explicit cell and update budgets prevent publication of
    partial normalized distributions. Arbitrary-precision integer and
    rational arithmetic is provided by the maintained 'gmp' package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/martinlofranodeoliveira/stratified-permutation-mass,
    https://lofranotecnologia.com.br
BugReports: https://github.com/martinlofranodeoliveira/stratified-permutation-mass/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports: gmp (>= 0.7-5), methods
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: no
